{'symbol': 'SHW', 'date': '2021-04-21 15:00:00', 'title': 'SHERWIN-WILLIAMS SHAREHOLDERS ELECT NEW DIRECTOR', 'text': "CLEVELAND, APRIL 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE SHERWIN-WILLIAMS COMPANY (NYSE: SHW) ANNOUNCED THAT AARON M. POWELL WAS ELECTED TO THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF SHERWIN-WILLIAMS AT THE COMPANY'S ANNUAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS TODAY."}{'symbol': 'SHW', 'date': '2021-04-21 14:15:00', 'title': 'SHERWIN-WILLIAMS DECLARES DIVIDEND OF $0.55 PER COMMON SHARE', 'text': 'CLEVELAND, APRIL 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF THE SHERWIN-WILLIAMS COMPANY (NYSE: SHW) TODAY ANNOUNCED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.55 PER COMMON SHARE PAYABLE ON JUNE 4, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON MAY 21, 2021. THE DIVIDEND RATE REFLECTS THE 3-FOR-1 STOCK SPLIT, DISTRIBUTED AFTER CLOSE OF TRADING ON MARCH 31, 2021, AND IS UNCHANGED FROM THE PREVIOUS QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, WHICH WAS $1.65 ON A PRE-SPLIT ADJUSTED BASIS.'}{'symbol': 'SHW', 'date': '2021-04-21 15:00:00', 'title': 'SHERWIN-WILLIAMS SHAREHOLDERS ELECT NEW DIRECTOR', 'text': "CLEVELAND, APRIL 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE SHERWIN-WILLIAMS COMPANY (NYSE: SHW) ANNOUNCED THAT AARON M. POWELL WAS ELECTED TO THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF SHERWIN-WILLIAMS AT THE COMPANY'S ANNUAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS TODAY."}{'symbol': 'SHW', 'date': '2021-04-21 14:15:00', 'title': 'SHERWIN-WILLIAMS DECLARES DIVIDEND OF $0.55 PER COMMON SHARE', 'text': 'CLEVELAND, APRIL 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF THE SHERWIN-WILLIAMS COMPANY (NYSE: SHW) TODAY ANNOUNCED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.55 PER COMMON SHARE PAYABLE ON JUNE 4, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON MAY 21, 2021. THE DIVIDEND RATE REFLECTS THE 3-FOR-1 STOCK SPLIT, DISTRIBUTED AFTER CLOSE OF TRADING ON MARCH 31, 2021, AND IS UNCHANGED FROM THE PREVIOUS QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, WHICH WAS $1.65 ON A PRE-SPLIT ADJUSTED BASIS.'}{'symbol': 'SHW', 'date': '2021-04-21 15:00:00', 'title': 'SHERWIN-WILLIAMS SHAREHOLDERS ELECT NEW DIRECTOR', 'text': "CLEVE